# ---------------------------------------------------------
# Conventional Commits Instructions
# ---------------------------------------------------------
# Subject line format: <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# Body format: Explain the motivation, context, and what changed.
# Footer format: Reference related issues (e.g., Closes #123) or BREAKING CHANGES.
#
# Valid types:
# - feat: A new feature
# - fix: A bug fix
# - docs: Documentation only changes
# - chore: Routine tasks, build processes, or maintenance
# - refactor: A code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
# - test: Adding or modifying tests
